 auf dem Oktoberfest zu ergaunern. Er will eine „Bierburg“ für 6.000 Gäste errichten – 20 Mal so groß wie die üblichen Bierbuden auf dem Oktoberfest. Und das als Auswärtiger! Ein Affront gegen die Münchner Brauergilde. Nur einer weigert sich, seinen Budenplatz zu verkaufen: Ignatz Hoflinger, Inhaber der kleinen traditionsbewussten Deibel-Brauerei, der mit seiner Frau Maria und den beiden Söhnen Roman und Ludwig auch das Wirtshaus „Zum Oiden Deibel“ betreibt."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y1rqA6is9Iav1jfyhPN9LkYyAxh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uQiG4fDBsho8mxfICXZ2bz8aGW1.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Miniserie","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Monaco di Baviera, 1900. L'ambizioso birraio Curt Prank ricorre a tattiche brutali pur di costruire un tendone che dominerà il redditizio Oktoberfest.","language":"it-IT"},"year":2020,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6YendaSlPXtknIE6GgAHgBTQzpn.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94002/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":94002,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y1rqA6is9Iav1jfyhPN9LkYyAxh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y1rqA6is9Iav1jfyhPN9LkYyAxh.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y1rqA6is9Iav1jfyhPN9LkYyAxh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y1rqA6is9Iav1jfyhPN9LkYyAxh.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4feT03w8nrxw7mNS3nsFdP23bfd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4feT03w8nrxw7mNS3nsFdP23bfd.jpg","language":"e